2
00:00:04,599 --> 00:00:11,140
In the above picture, a man drives his car to buy some soy sauce,

3
00:00:11,149 --> 00:00:15,080
but evidently the errand takes him too long a time.

4
00:00:15,089 --> 00:00:17,600
Amusing as the picture seems,

5
00:00:17,609 --> 00:00:24,490
it compels us to consider this question: is private car a plus or a minus?

6
00:00:24,499 --> 00:00:29,300
It has been a controversial issue whether or not we should possess a car.

7
00:00:29,309 --> 00:00:34,000
Advocates say we derive numerous benefits from private cars,

8
00:00:34,009 --> 00:00:39,910
which enable us to go anywhere at any time without relying on public transport.

9
00:00:39,919 --> 00:00:42,540
But others hold views to the contrary.

10
00:00:42,549 --> 00:00:47,680
They argue that traffic jams caused by the booming number of private cars

11
00:00:47,689 --> 00:00:54,670
are driving people mad. In addition, the exhaust fumes emitted by motor vehicles,

12
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:56,860
most of which are private cars,

13
00:00:56,869 --> 00:01:01,130
remains one of the primary sources of pollution in cities.

14
00:01:01,139 --> 00:01:07,030
It seems unwise to abandon private vehicles in light of its convenience.

15
00:01:07,039 --> 00:01:12,830
However, at least we can take actions to reduce its disadvantages.

16
00:01:12,839 --> 00:01:17,320
Above all, we need to limit the use of private cars.

17
00:01:17,329 --> 00:01:20,600
Private car owners in Beijing, for example,

18
00:01:20,609 --> 00:01:23,770
are allowed to drive only on alternate days.

19
00:01:23,779 --> 00:01:24,750
In addition,

20
00:01:24,759 --> 00:01:30,000
it is essential to improve public transport and encourage the use of bicycles.

21
00:01:30,009 --> 00:01:32,950
As is clearly shown in the above picture,

22
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:37,770
rather than drive a car, the man may just as well ride a bicycle,

23
00:01:37,779 --> 00:01:39,770
which will save him much valuable time in traffic congestion.

